{"id": "n01", "retrieved": [{"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 26.36, "end": 105.52, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000026360"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 75.14, "end": 149.49, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000075140"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 105.52, "end": 156.65, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000105520"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 359.48, "end": 417.17, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000359480"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 26.49, "end": 75.14, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000026490"}, {"video_id": "C3NwjB5xl6k", "start": 104.21, "end": 156.46, "span_id": "C3NwjB5xl6k_000104210"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 417.17, "end": 501.07, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000417170"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 149.49, "end": 216.9, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000149490"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 157.88, "end": 232.62, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000157880"}, {"video_id": "1MFwC2ESVuw", "start": 1553.53, "end": 1624.13, "span_id": "1MFwC2ESVuw_001553530"}], "answer": "Machine learning is a process where machines learn from data to perform tasks without being explicitly programmed. [Video Machine Learning (Ml) In Hindi - Course Intro, 00:00:26–00:01:45] It involves building intuition about data, understanding it, and deciding which models to use and how to train or validate them. [Video Practical Machine Learning, 00:01:15–00:02:29] Machine learning is used in various applications like recommendation systems, voice assistants, fraud detection, and auto-correction features. [Video Machine Learning (Ml) In Hindi - Course Intro, 00:01:45–00:02:36] It includes two main aspects: supervised learning, where the machine learns from labeled data, and unsupervised learning, where the machine learns patterns from unlabeled data. [Video Machine Learning (Ml) In Hindi - Course Intro, 00:05:59–00:06:57]", "abstained": false, "citations": [{"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 26.36, "end": 105.52, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000026360"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 75.14, "end": 149.49, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000075140"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 105.52, "end": 156.65, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000105520"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 359.48, "end": 417.17, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000359480"}], "outcome": "answered_with_caution"}
