{"id": "n03", "retrieved": [{"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 25.98, "end": 92.14, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000025980"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 1655.39, "end": 1704.0, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_001655390"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 1014.02, "end": 1079.18, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_001014020"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 305.14, "end": 394.09, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000305140"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 215.8, "end": 305.03, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000215800"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 1369.18, "end": 1432.52, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_001369180"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 394.14, "end": 440.65, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000394140"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 1080.47, "end": 1156.26, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_001080470"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 1054.78, "end": 1112.3, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_001054780"}, {"video_id": "gKuLG48fH94", "start": 1368.14, "end": 1441.98, "span_id": "gKuLG48fH94_001368140"}], "answer": "Overfitting occurs when a model performs very well on training data but poorly on testing data. [Video Practical Machine Learning -Part 2, 00:00:25–00:01:32] It happens because the model becomes too complex and starts memorizing the training samples instead of learning generalizable features. [Video Practical Machine Learning, 00:27:35–00:28:24] In overfitting, the decision boundary becomes overly sensitive to specific training data points, leading to poor performance on unseen data. [Video Practical Machine Learning -Part 2, 00:03:35–00:05:05] To detect overfitting, compare the model's performance on training data with its performance on validation or test data. [Video Practical Machine Learning -Part 2, 00:06:34–00:07:20]", "abstained": false, "citations": [{"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 25.98, "end": 92.14, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000025980"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 1655.39, "end": 1704.0, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_001655390"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 215.8, "end": 305.03, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000215800"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 394.14, "end": 440.65, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000394140"}], "outcome": "answered"}
