{"id": "n08", "retrieved": [{"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 26.36, "end": 105.52, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000026360"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 26.49, "end": 75.14, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000026490"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 359.48, "end": 417.17, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000359480"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 75.14, "end": 149.49, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000075140"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 105.52, "end": 156.65, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000105520"}, {"video_id": "C3NwjB5xl6k", "start": 104.21, "end": 156.46, "span_id": "C3NwjB5xl6k_000104210"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 417.17, "end": 501.07, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000417170"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65A4", "start": 149.49, "end": 216.9, "span_id": "Lndyuu_65A4_000149490"}, {"video_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU", "start": 25.98, "end": 92.14, "span_id": "yQUjWHWtYxU_000025980"}, {"video_id": "-D1g1apkDms", "start": 237.46, "end": 304.68, "span_id": "-D1g1apkDms_000237460"}], "answer": "मशीन लर्निंग एक ऐसा क्षेत्र है जिसमें मशीन को खुद डेटा से सीखना होता है। [Video Machine Learning (Ml) In Hindi - Course Intro, 00:05:59–00:06:57] मशीन लर्निंग के दो मुख्य प्रकार होते हैं: सुपरवाइज्ड लर्निंग और अनसुपरवाइज्ड लर्निंग। [Video Machine Learning (Ml) In Hindi - Course Intro, 00:05:59–00:06:57] मशीन लर्निंग के उपयोग से आर्टिफिशियल इंटेलिजेंस के अनेक अनुप्रयोग जैसे चैटबॉट, रिकमेंडेशन सिस्टम आदि संभव हो गए हैं। [Video Machine Learning (Ml) In Hindi - Course Intro, 00:00:26–00:01:45] मशीन लर्निंग में मॉडल को ट्रेन करने और टेस्ट करने के लिए बहुत सारे प्रैक्टिकल आस्पेक्ट्स होते हैं। [Video Practical Machine Learning, 00:00:26–00:01:15]", "abstained": false, "citations": [{"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 359.48, "end": 417.17, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000359480"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 359.48, "end": 417.17, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000359480"}, {"video_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E", "start": 26.36, "end": 105.52, "span_id": "O9Tjcc0Dm-E_000026360"}, {"video_id": "Lndyuu_65